      "content": "i understand but i really don't want to call my doctor this late and talk to a pharmacist is just gonna take forever lol. how bad is the interaction actually? like is it something i really need to worry about for just one dose or is it just a \"be careful\" type of thing? it's just a standard cough syrup i bought at the grocery store.",
